OL,3,GNEWSAAt-risk park and ride site to stay
OL,4,Aopen - for now
OL,5,
OL,6,FShropshire Council said it plans to
OL,7,Fkeep the Meole Brace park and ride
OL,8,Fservice in Shrewsbury running beyond
OL,9,FNovember ` just months after announcing
OL,10,Fits closure.
OL,12,FThe authority had originally planned to
OL,13,Fwithdraw the service after a reduction
OL,14,Fin government bus funding compared with
OL,15,Fprevious years, alongside increasing
OL,16,Fcosts for bus operators.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
