OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1790265367
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAAt-risk park and ride site to stay
OL,4,Aopen - for now
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Shropshire Council's deputy leader,
OL,7,FAlex Wagner, said about #500,000 of
OL,8,Fincreased parking charge revenue would
OL,9,Fbe used to keep the service going while
OL,10,Fa long-term solution to the town's park
OL,11,Fand ride provisions could be found.
OL,13,FHe said residents had made their
OL,14,Ffeelings "very clear" about the
OL,15,Fclosure, and that council leaders had
OL,16,Flistened to their concerns.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
